@api = http://localhost:5100

### 1. Kiem tra may chu dang chay -> 200
GET {{api}}/

### 2. Danh sach san pham -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/products

### 3. Chi tiet san pham ton tai -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/products/1

### 4. San pham khong ton tai -> 404 + ApiError
GET {{api}}/api/products/999

### 5. Sai kieu du lieu id -> 404 (rong)
GET {{api}}/api/products/abc

### 6. Tao san pham hop le -> 201 Created + Location
POST {{api}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Lap trinh gRPC",
  "description": "Tai lieu bai 5",
  "price": 80000
}

### 7. Tao san pham loi (gia am) -> 400 Bad Request
POST {{api}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "San pham loi",
  "description": "",
  "price": -1
}

### 8. Tao san pham thieu Content-Type -> 415 Unsupported Media Type
POST {{api}}/api/products

{
  "name": "Lap trinh gRPC",
  "description": "Tai lieu bai 5",
  "price": 80000
}